      "en": "When Judah looked back, behold, the battle was before and behind them; and they cried to the LORD, and the priests sounded with the trumpets.",
      "ko": "유다 사람이 돌이켜 보고 자기 앞 뒤의 적병을 인하여 여호와께 부르짖고 제사장은 나팔을 부니라",
      "source_text_hash": "10f8f007bcc7b70b2d897d01067dd76970cd15d0df1126574213d8861b083ee2",
      "translation_text_hash": "166984a8b6c6d77daf406d17b0e70ee7a21df2f1b6e57139455c0f57942e2676",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
