      "en": "Abijah pursued Jeroboam, and took cities from him: Bethel with its villages, Jeshanah with its villages, and Ephron with its villages.",
      "ko": "아비야가 여로보암을 쫓아가서 그 성읍들을 빼앗았으니 곧 벧엘과 그 동네와 여사나와 그 동네와 에브론과 그 동네라",
      "source_text_hash": "3f7ddc86db3627b96175bcbc3a5b6c3fc8d4bc976c06777fec5b99fd8f7476fa",
      "translation_text_hash": "f39feaec414651ca56afc5ca4d1156ebbd3927720d56294d068776c31e58053f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
